      "text": "The posthog-analytics OpenClaw plugin runs in-process with the gateway, hooks agent lifecycle events (e.g. before_model_resolve, before_tool_call, agent_end), and emits PostHog AI events; it is installed automatically during bootstrap when a PostHog project key is available."
